      "id": "206:p0",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "$t1 == '206'?\r\n`",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48444:48460"
    },
    {
      "id": "206:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48460:48462"
    },
    {
      "id": "206:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "天啊，那是什么东西？\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48462:48474"
    },
    {
      "id": "206:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你站起身走到窗户边，朝窗外的黑暗中看去。你什么都看不见。你把窗帘牢牢拉上，又把床头的窗帘也拉紧。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48474:48524"
    },
    {
      "id": "206:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你强压了压心头的火，看着电视机。那个邪祟而难以辨别的生物就像是在窥视，穿过窗户——\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48524:48567"
    },
    {
      "id": "206:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "穿过电视屏幕——直直地盯着你。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48567:48584"
    },
    {
      "id": "206:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "记录你当前所在的条目，你可能需要回到当前条目。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48584:48609"
    },
    {
      "id": "206:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "失去 1D4 点理智。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48609:48622"
    },
    {
      "id": "206:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "回到 186。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:48622:48631"
    }
  ]
}
